{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNGALAND combines action-adventure, and platforming with exploring a vast, cartoon-styled world to discover the island is full of life and surprises at every corner. Explore the different paths packed with enemies and get ready to face them head-on with a<strong> WILD</strong> arsenal of weapons only you can wield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a07385e9f9898e5b8370973c09cc3d51.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a07385e9f9898e5b8370973c09cc3d51.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a07385e9f9898e5b8370973c09cc3d51.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/250fc2fb5cf385b97aa46832a5a91276.avif?t=1756221757\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the dangers deep within the island of <strong>Wa-Kabum</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden by overcoming each trial thrown your way; it\u2019s up to you to face these dangers head-on and return victorious Not as the <strong>Hero</strong> they seek, but as the <strong>Brute</strong> they need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/da6883ee8bf29cd98c35f27e73e81ca7.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/da6883ee8bf29cd98c35f27e73e81ca7.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/da6883ee8bf29cd98c35f27e73e81ca7.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/59cd647cc11efe172f1454a583dc54f6.avif?t=1756221757\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Exciting Gameplay Experience</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become <strong>Oogie</strong> and face the various enemies in challenging <strong>hand-to-hand combat</strong>, relying on his reflexes to block and dodge the enemy attacks to defeat them to earn resources or new equipment. This allows players to upgrade their attributes, explore new paths on the map, and <strong>unlock new treasures to find</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/9b9e6caef5c42ecede598347378bd293.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/9b9e6caef5c42ecede598347378bd293.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/9b9e6caef5c42ecede598347378bd293.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/839428a51b8753d2ab8c791f5cb12cfa.avif?t=1756221757\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amazing Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the land of Wa-Kabum, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>Primal Seeds;</strong> using these seeds will allow different upgrades to your equipped weapon, making each battle unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a56d734dc739c62388bd13d930187624.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a56d734dc739c62388bd13d930187624.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a56d734dc739c62388bd13d930187624.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explode, freeze, teleport, black holes\u2014Oogie can do it all! And with you by his side, the sky is the limit! Create the craziest combinations to discover the world around you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Levels\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels will offer you many paths to <strong>explore</strong> freely and uncover all <strong>the rewards</strong> that only the bravest (or the most reckless) would dare to seek. However, tread carefully and be ready to face the enemies and traps of <strong>Wa-Kabum</strong> Island. <strong>Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth behind the island?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367020?t=1756221757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/64c7bae08d34dbd4e3db156ab914946eada091c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756221757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/e414ea11364e50daaef5a68b462cbbedc6a73d61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756221757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/e414ea11364e50daaef5a68b462cbbedc6a73d61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756221757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNGALAND combines action-adventure, and platforming with exploring a vast, cartoon-styled world to discover the island is full of life and surprises at every corner. Explore the different paths packed with enemies and get ready to face them head-on with a<strong> WILD</strong> arsenal of weapons only you can wield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a07385e9f9898e5b8370973c09cc3d51.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a07385e9f9898e5b8370973c09cc3d51.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/a07385e9f9898e5b8370973c09cc3d51.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/250fc2fb5cf385b97aa46832a5a91276.avif?t=1756221757\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer the dangers deep within the island of <strong>Wa-Kabum</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden by overcoming each trial thrown your way; it\u2019s up to you to face these dangers head-on and return victorious Not as the <strong>Hero</strong> they seek, but as the <strong>Brute</strong> they need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/da6883ee8bf29cd98c35f27e73e81ca7.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/da6883ee8bf29cd98c35f27e73e81ca7.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/da6883ee8bf29cd98c35f27e73e81ca7.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/59cd647cc11efe172f1454a583dc54f6.avif?t=1756221757\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Exciting Gameplay Experience</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become <strong>Oogie</strong> and face the various enemies in challenging <strong>hand-to-hand combat</strong>, relying on his reflexes to block and dodge the enemy attacks to defeat them to earn resources or new equipment. This allows players to upgrade their attributes, explore new paths on the map, and <strong>unlock new treasures to find</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/9b9e6caef5c42ecede598347378bd293.poster.avif?t=1756221757\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/9b9e6caef5c42ecede598347378bd293.webm?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367020/extras/9b9e6caef5c42ecede598347378bd293.mp4?t=1756221757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa